<title>THAILAND: Siam Cement 1996 net rises 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Siam Cement 1996 net rises 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited unconsolidated financial results for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		30.17     vs	   25.97</p>
<p>    Net		    3,620.39     vs	3,116.84</p>
<p>NOTES: Revenues not stated. Company's full name is the Siam Cement Plc, an industrial and construction materials company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950-3</p>
</text>
